SCOPY   START 1000
        LDA   ONE
        STA   TWO
        COMP  TWO
        JEQ   SCOPY
EXIT    TIX   TWELVE
        JGT   SCOPY
        LDX   TWO
        STX   ONE
        ADD   EIGHT
        SUB   SIXTY
ONE     WORD  1
TWO     WORD  2
EIGHT   WORD  8
TWELVE  WORD  12
SIXTY   WORD  16
        END
